      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BOLD THRUSTER (5) has a strong record this track and trip with two wins and two placings from six starts. Below best last time at this track (31.07) in a Grade 4/5, finishing a 18 length sixth. Looks suited and should go close. HIGHLY CONNECTED (3) hasn't been far away here at the last two, finding the frame both times, most recently when second beaten 7 lengths (30.29). The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Ready to find winning form. GO HOME GIRL (2) finished eighth last time at Warragul but could not have been more impressive before that in her head turning 25.80 win at Warragul over 460m. Top win two back and rates a key player again. LAKEVIEW SNEAKY (1) cannot be ruled out.",
